# toolie: a read-only explorer, modeled on kaibo's. One tool, the read-only
# `shell`: `facade:shell` projects it into the model's roster and gives the
# person's shell box the same read-only shell. Files, `git`, blocks, and
# kernel search are all reached through it (`cat`, `grep`, `kj block read`,
# `kj search`). The toolie never holds `facade:shell_write`, `exec`, or a
# write tool.
set -e
kj binding allow "facade:shell"
